failure_paths:
  - invalid_device_identity
  - device_not_found
  - device_not_claimed
  - heartbeat_rate_limited
  - heartbeat_storm
idempotency: per-device per-replica acceptance window (DEVICE_HEARTBEAT_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS default 10s) short-circuits BEFORE DB writes
